00:53:01.920 --> 00:53:04.410
She's really inspired by books
that are about self-help,

00:53:04.410 --> 00:53:06.690
changing your personality, improving it.

00:53:06.690 --> 00:53:09.847
Another person she reads is Wataz Mishan.

00:53:12.640 --> 00:53:15.440
Wataz Mishan and he has a
book called (speaking Arabic).

00:53:21.330 --> 00:53:24.690
Act foolish, a little bit?

00:53:24.690 --> 00:53:26.100
That's foolish?

00:53:26.100 --> 00:53:27.491
Act foolish?

00:53:27.491 --> 00:53:29.220
We can see them here, it's okay.

00:53:29.220 --> 00:53:30.480
Act foolish,

00:53:30.480 --> 00:53:32.973
maybe that's the best paraphrasing.

00:53:34.868 --> 00:53:37.270
She's also read the book by Malala

00:53:38.400 --> 00:53:40.440
and she read my book which I'm gonna say

00:53:40.440 --> 00:53:42.030
'cause I want people to...

00:53:42.030 --> 00:53:43.410
The reason I'm saying it

00:53:43.410 --> 00:53:45.570
is I wanna inspire others
to write their story, right?

00:53:45.570 --> 00:53:47.246
It's not that my story is very special.

00:53:47.246 --> 00:53:49.680
I'm sure there are millions
of special stories,

00:53:49.680 --> 00:53:50.850
but we need to write them.

00:53:50.850 --> 00:53:52.799
And I say this to
whoever's listening on Zoom

00:53:52.799 --> 00:53:55.230
and to the young students here,

00:53:55.230 --> 00:53:58.440
is that the most of the
literature is written

00:53:58.440 --> 00:54:00.990
from one perspective by the global north

00:54:00.990 --> 00:54:02.730
and we need to read the
stories of people coming

00:54:02.730 --> 00:54:04.350
from the global south,
for lack of a better word.

00:54:04.350 --> 00:54:05.490
I don't like global south either,

00:54:05.490 --> 00:54:08.580
but I have to just portray
what I'm talking about,

00:54:08.580 --> 00:54:09.510
to write our stories

00:54:09.510 --> 00:54:11.310
because we owe it to ourselves

00:54:11.310 --> 00:54:12.630
and we owe it to the next generation

00:54:12.630 --> 00:54:14.833
to hear our stories and our voices.

00:54:14.833 --> 00:54:17.145
I'm sure Asmaa's gonna write
her story, right Asmaa?

